"chartObservations":[]},{"pageId":"d1596d1446e83_p4","documentSha256":"1596d1446e8393195e632e042b1fc85c10c5a9989edf65f50b55a2e554933e3c","pageNumber":4,"text":[{"text":"                          NovoPsych","bbox":[199.358,56.4795,395.91794,78.4635],"origin":[199.358,73.6795],"font":"Helvetica","size":16.0,"colour":"#007ba3","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[106.06932,112.74515,175.41731,129.26915],"origin":[106.06932,125.58514],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[187.41733,113.23909,257.10233,128.35309],"origin":[187.41733,125.06409],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses (cont.)","bbox":[74.03149,139.87529,238.1675,159.15329],"origin":[74.03149,154.85529],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"14","bbox":[73.22675,165.78212,82.67875,177.46112],"origin":[73.22675,174.91962],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"My family or friends would say I","bbox":[93.87402,165.78212,212.43204,177.46112],"origin":[93.87402,174.91962],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Do not worry enough about my health","bbox":[90.87402,183.35555,246.78952,195.03455],"origin":[90.87402,192.49304],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Have a normal attitude to my health","bbox":[90.87402,197.38625,239.22455,209.06525],"origin":[90.87402,206.52374],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Worry too much about my health","bbox":[90.87402,211.55946,227.87703,223.23846],"origin":[90.87402,220.69696],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    Am a hypochondriac","bbox":[90.87402,225.72618,189.12549,237.47318],"origin":[90.87402,234.84668],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"15","bbox":[73.22675,266.53857,82.67875,278.21759],"origin":[73.22675,275.67609],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For the following questions, please think about what it might be like if you had a serious illness of a type which","bbox":[90.87402,243.16359,503.78738,254.84259],"origin":[90.87402,252.30109],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"particularly concerns you (such as heart disease, cancer, multiple sclerosis, etc). Obviously you cannot know for","bbox":[90.87402,252.51363,511.77744,264.19263],"origin":[90.87402,261.65112],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"certain what it would be like; but please give your best estimate of what you think might happen, basing your","bbox":[90.87402,261.86359,497.18298,273.5426],"origin":[90.87402,271.0011],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"estimate on what you know about yourself and serious illness in general.","bbox":[90.87402,271.21356,363.46921,282.89258],"origin":[90.87402,280.35107],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"If I had a serious illness I would","bbox":[90.87402,289.91357,208.98148,301.59259],"origin":[90.87402,299.05109],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Still be able to enjoy things in my life quite a lot","bbox":[90.87402,307.487,281.27408,319.16602],"origin":[90.87402,316.62451],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Still be able to enjoy things in my life a little","bbox":[90.87402,321.51773,266.62003,333.19675],"origin":[90.87402,330.65524],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Be almost completely unable to enjoy things in my life","bbox":[90.87402,335.82697,324.22467,347.57397],"origin":[90.87402,344.94748],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    Be completely unable to enjoy life at all","bbox":[90.87402,349.72168,251.98299,361.4007],"origin":[90.87402,358.85919],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"16","bbox":[73.22675,367.29507,82.67875,378.97409],"origin":[73.22675,376.43259],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"If I developed a serious illness I think the chances that modern medicine would be able to cure me is","bbox":[90.87402,367.29507,467.88342,378.97409],"origin":[90.87402,376.43259],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Good","bbox":[90.87402,384.8685,125.843,396.54752],"origin":[90.87402,394.00601],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Moderate","bbox":[90.87402,398.89923,140.95601,410.57825],"origin":[90.87402,408.03674],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Small","bbox":[90.87402,413.20844,127.73001,424.95544],"origin":[90.87402,422.32895],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    No chance","bbox":[90.87402,427.10318,145.68201,438.7822],"origin":[90.87402,436.24069],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"17","bbox":[73.22675,444.67657,82.67875,456.35559],"origin":[73.22675,453.81409],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"A serious illness would ruin my life in","bbox":[90.87402,444.67657,229.27098,456.35559],"origin":[90.87402,453.81409],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Some aspects","bbox":[90.87402,462.25,158.908,473.92902],"origin":[90.87402,471.38751],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Many aspects","bbox":[90.87402,476.28073,157.48851,487.95975],"origin":[90.87402,485.41824],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Almost every aspect","bbox":[90.87402,490.58994,187.72302,502.33694],"origin":[90.87402,499.71045],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    Every aspect","bbox":[90.87402,504.48468,154.18201,516.1637],"origin":[90.87402,513.62219],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"18","bbox":[73.22675,522.05804,82.67875,533.73706],"origin":[73.22675,531.19556],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"If I had a serious illness I would feel that I had","bbox":[90.87402,522.05804,262.85452,533.73706],"origin":[90.87402,531.19556],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0    Not lost my dignity","bbox":[90.87402,539.63147,174.48851,551.31049],"origin":[90.87402,548.76898],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1    Lost a little of my dignity","bbox":[90.87402,553.66217,195.75552,565.34119],"origin":[90.87402,562.79968],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2    Lost quite a lot of my dignity","bbox":[90.87402,567.97144,220.76256,579.71844],"origin":[90.87402,577.09192],"font":"Helvetica-BoldOblique","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3    Totally lost my dignity","bbox":[90.87402,581.86615,186.29501,593.54517],"origin":[90.87402,591.00366],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Powered by TCPDF (www.tcpdf.org)","bbox":[3.0,839.59003,19.17,840.96405],"origin":[3.0,840.66504],"font":"Helvetica","size":1.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 4 of 4","bbox":[467.71652,784.13007,523.98157,799.24408],"origin":[467.71652,795.95508],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":